WerkbankHelpIntro = Short and in order: what you do where. The link on the right takes you there.
WerkbankHelpGo = Open
WerkbankHelp_send_Title = Send documents to a customer
WerkbankHelp_send_Text = Open the tab <b>Unterlagen</b> of the customer. The bar on top shows how much is done; <b>Send all missing</b> puts every open required document into one e-mail. One by one: <b>Send</b> in the line. The mail form chooses the template "Unterlagen zusenden" and writes the list with "Stand" and what to do itself.
WerkbankHelp_generate_Title = Generate a document for a customer (AVV, remote maintenance)
WerkbankHelp_generate_Text = Templates per customer are never sent blank. In the tab <b>Unterlagen</b> click <b>Generate</b>, choose contract and contact, fill in the fields – the PDF is kept with the customer (and the contract). Without a line: add it below under <b>More documents</b>, or use <b>Generate for a customer …</b> on the template's card.
WerkbankHelp_sign_Title = Have it signed on the phone
WerkbankHelp_sign_Text = <b>Sign</b> in the line opens the signature fields for both. Once signed, the document is "done" and the signed copy is kept with the customer. Interrupted? <b>Continue signing</b>.
WerkbankHelp_documents_Title = Edit and release documents
WerkbankHelp_documents_Text = Third parties → <b>Unterlagen</b>. Change the text, save, <b>Release</b>: a new version with "Stand" and PDF. Leave "may be sent to customers" off for internal text blocks. Legal texts marked public show on the website.
WerkbankHelp_rules_Title = Who needs which document
WerkbankHelp_rules_Text = Setup → <b>Unterlagen je Kunde</b>. Each rule: which document, for whom (company/private, contract with product, tag), what the customer does. Reminders, agenda history and business hours are set there too.
WerkbankHelp_followup_Title = Forget nothing
WerkbankHelp_followup_Text = The widget <b>Open</b> on the start page shows missing documents, mails without reply, signatures begun and open QS checklists. With reminders on, the module writes again after the days set.
WerkbankHelp_qs_Title = Quality check (QS)
WerkbankHelp_qs_Text = Work through the checklist on the intervention, do the required points, close it: the test report is made as PDF and can be signed on the phone and sent.
WerkbankHelp_intake_Title = Device intake
WerkbankHelp_intake_Text = Make the <b>intake slip</b> on the ticket, have it signed on the phone by you and the customer; the PDF is kept with the ticket and the customer.
WerkbankHelp_pricelist_Title = Price list
WerkbankHelp_pricelist_Text = Comes from the products: choose the categories in the setup. When a price changes, the module writes the price list PDF again.
WerkbankHelp_mails_Title = E-mail templates
WerkbankHelp_mails_Text = All templates "… · Sie" and "… · Du" come from the module. You may change them; "Update templates" in the setup brings untouched ones up to date.
WerkbankHelp_check_Title = When something does not work
WerkbankHelp_check_Text = The <b>System check</b> shows what is missing in Dolibarr (rights, cron, logo, templates, rules) and where to fix it.
